<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine money market closes for holiday.</title>
<headline>Philippine money market closes for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>---------------------- May 1 -------------------------</p>
<p>	  * Trading resumes on Friday</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The Philippine money market was closed on Thursday, Labour Day.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Friday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, Manila overnight money was unchanged at 10.28125 percent but traders said they expected rates to rise on Friday after the Central Bank lifted its overnight borrowing rate by 0.75 percentage point to 11 percent.</p>
<p>--MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8936, FAX 817-6267</p>
